comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-21T04:23:02.916Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: complete live 3034-item all-status snapshot with no omissions plus keyword searches for union options budget result and conditional result types found no exact active owner. The existing pm-oybmsd owns sparse producer envelopes, while this separate shared conditional-type defect affects every bounded read. Both are bundled under pm-srns without claiming the broader parent."
  "2026-10-21T04:28:15.063Z","harness:codex","Regression sensitivity: the same initial fixture against an isolated pre-fix source copy exits 2 with unused unsafe-items expectations for union option shapes. Producer page assertions separately expose falsely required metadata. Current correction distributes Options before key inspection. No runtime payload or budget policy is changed."
  "2026-10-21T04:34:31.395Z","harness:codex","PM-linked pnpm typecheck passes all four configurations. The shared packed acceptance also compiles the identical union-option and combined producer-budget fixture using public sdk, sdk/core and sdk/contracts declarations. Static/security and full source coverage are being completed before closure."
  "2026-10-21T05:41:27.683Z","harness:codex","All final PM-linked compiler checks and the shared source and actual-tarball public declaration fixture pass, including forbidden unsafe access for budget/session/output-cursor unions and composed producer-budget variants. Complete accepted source coverage is exact 100/100/100/100. The isolated pre-fix compiler fails the independent expectations."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-21T05:07:53.485Z","harness:codex",Conditional SDK result types must distribute over option unions before inspecting keys. keyof applied to a union keeps shared keys and can erase a real budget-omission branch; verify forbidden access through a packed public declaration consumer.
